OL,3,GNEWSAAction programme aims to make city
OL,4,Acentre safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to improve Bradford city centre
OL,7,Fand make it a cleaner and safer space
OL,8,Ffor people living, working and visiting
OL,9,Fthere has been launched.
OL,11,FThe Bradford City Centre Action
OL,12,FPartnership aims to bring together
OL,13,Fseveral organisations as part of a
OL,14,Fcoordinated programme of action.
OL,16,FIts first major initiative was a "day
OL,17,Fof action" on Tuesday which saw West
OL,18,FYorkshire Police work alongside the
OL,19,Fcouncil, homeless outreach services and
OL,20,Flocal businesses.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
